Description:
 sophomorix-belwue-mail - Reading external Mail data at Belwue and suggest actions
 sophomorix-developer - Test suite for sophomorix-samba
 sophomorix-dump - Migration dump script
 sophomorix-samba - Sophomorix for Samba 4
 sophomorix-vampire - Migration vampire script
Changes:
 sophomorix4 (7.4.7) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] [sophomorix-quota] The smbcquotas command was printed with
     the administrator password in clear: on every quota set
     (AD_user_setquota), and when querying a user (--smbcquotas,
     --smbcquotas-only). The password is masked, including one holding
     regex special characters.
   * [sophomorix-quota] A user's quota is queried on the DFS target of a
     share served by another fileserver, as it already was when setting
     it.
   * [sophomorix-query] --quota-usage queries the DFS target of a share
     served by another fileserver, and reports a failed query as an
     error instead of 0 MiB used.
   * [sophomorix-passwd] A random password shorter than 4 characters is
     refused with an error instead of looping forever: it needs one
     character of each of the 4 classes.
